// With you at the Mac (render/gel/face.h, showWithYou; render/gel/gaze.h), each on a frozen clock after a
// reset. Nothing told: it rests. Your pointer, while it moves: its eyes follow it and it leans a little
// its way (to your left, your right, up), and at the screen's edge nearest it, it looks right at it and
// leans in. Scrolling: it reads along, turned to the Mac, its eyes going down a line; you stop, they
// flick back up; two minutes on, settled in, lids half down. Typing fast: eyes a little wider, paws
// quicker; a long stretch of typing stopped, a look up at you. Music: half-closed eyes and a sway,
// then a rest, then a look round as it stops. A video: turned to the screen, still. A call: still,
// smaller, eyes half; a stretch as it ends. A copy held: cheeks puffed; let go, a pah.
